I've built Aura, a dark-mode AI life coach app with two routes:

Landing page (/) — a glowing gradient header with a teal→emerald aura effect, a sticky glass nav, a hero featuring a generated glowing "presence" orb and a sample conversation, a six-card feature grid, and a CTA + footer.
Chat dashboard (/chat) — a conversation sidebar with recent chats and a user profile, a live message thread with Aura's orb avatar, quick-reply suggestion chips, a typing indicator, and a clean auto-growing chat input box (with Send button, Enter-to-submit, and IME-safe composition handling).
I themed everything through globals.css with a calming teal/emerald-on-near-black palette, wired up Geist fonts, forced dark mode in the layout, and updated the metadata for SEO. Buttons that navigate use Base UI's render + nativeButton={false} so they render as proper accessible anchors. Want me to hook the chat up to a real AI model with the AI SDK next?


